2. Vector Storage - DOCUMENTED PRICING
Official Documentation:

"Vertex AI RAG Engine is free to use. However, if you configure Vertex AI RAG Engine components, the billing might be affected." (Source: RAG Engine Billing)

⚠️ Gap: Google does not publish explicit vector storage pricing for RAG Engine.

Calculation Based on Storage:



Assumptions:
- 100 tenants
- Each tenant: 50 pages of SOPs
- Each page: ~500 tokens
- Total tokens: 100 × 50 × 500 = 2.5 million tokens
Document Processing:
- 2.5M tokens ÷ 512 tokens per chunk = ~4,900 chunks
- Each chunk → 768-dimensional vector (text-embedding-005)
- Each vector: ~3 KB in storage
Total Vector Storage:
- 4,900 chunks × 3 KB = 14.7 MB
- Round up to: 20 MB (with metadata)
Storage Cost:
- Google Cloud Storage (if used): $0.020 per GB/month
- 0.02 GB × $0.020 = $0.0004/month (negligible)
However: Vectors are stored in Spanner (RagManagedDb), not separate storage.

Estimated Cost: $0 (included in Spanner tier cost above)

3. Embedding Generation - DOCUMENTED PRICING
Official Documentation:

"Text Embeddings API pricing: $0.00002 per 1,000 characters" (Source: Vertex AI Pricing)

Initial Ingestion (One-Time):



SOP Documents:
- 100 tenants × 50 pages = 5,000 pages
- Each page: ~2,000 characters average
- Total: 5,000 × 2,000 = 10 million characters
Embedding Cost:
- 10M characters ÷ 1,000 = 10,000 units
- 10,000 × $0.00002 = $0.20
One-Time Cost: $0.20
Monthly Updates (Recurring):



Assumption: 10% of tenants update SOPs monthly
- 10 tenants × 50 pages × 2,000 chars = 1M characters
- 1M ÷ 1,000 × $0.00002 = $0.02/month
Monthly Recurring: $0.02/month (negligible)
Query Embeddings (Per Query):



Each query generates 1 embedding:
- Average query: 100 characters
- 100K queries × 100 chars = 10M characters/month
- 10M ÷ 1,000 × $0.00002 = $0.20/month
Monthly Recurring: $0.20/month
Total Embedding Cost: $0.22/month (recurring) + $0.20 one-time

